    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"letting the quiet take over\"... that's what i want. i just want that peace. but i'm stuck in this loop. every time i think i'm getting better, the grayness just comes back heavier. it feels like a trap. is there even a way out of this, or is this just how it is now? is there any real way to actually find that rest you're talking about?",
